{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the trials. Improvise. Survive Together. Get paid -- or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team wake up in the depths of Exogen Labs, a brutalist underground facility where &quot;volunteers&quot; are legally bound to participate in highly questionable medical trials. Work together, survive the experiments, and you might leave rich. Fail...and you'll probably end up as part of the next experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b90460477d448c2563f20627eb57bf35.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Body parts are your weapons and tools. Rip them off, throw them away, and pick up something fresher from the floor. Improvise your arsenal from whatever is still twitching nearby. Arms, claws, mutated limbs -- if it comes off, you can probably use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0c84b62f04353f38e45f2701e30dfcbc.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Welcome to Exogen Labs. Our test chambers are filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant \u2018Things\u2019. No trial is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layouts will shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will mutate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the objectives and escape before the elevator timer expires...or you might expire with it! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b0c4dd9add45121f3ba666b3df97e63c.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>The trials are designed to test communication and coordination. Survival requires teamwork. You\u2019ll discuss tactics, plan attacks and  occasionally share body parts. Sometimes lending a hand might cost you an arm (and a leg). <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0fee8a603873e026aee104e849ccaf59.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Survive, adapt, and earn \u2018gold\u2019 - after all, why else would you sign the waiver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>Spend it on upgrades; weapons, buffs, limbs, maybe a tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United you stand. Divided\u2026 you still stand, just on fewer legs.     <br>    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675340?t=1774319350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/e4043469a71118f01233b6756a16f6072472a426/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774319350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/edf48788da63a2018b4bf3a463ae7c09959554ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774319350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/edf48788da63a2018b4bf3a463ae7c09959554ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774319350","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Killing Things With Your Friends contains mature content such as gore and over-the-top blood but leans heavily into dark humour and not outright horror or realistic violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the trials. Improvise. Survive Together. Get paid -- or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team wake up in the depths of Exogen Labs, a brutalist underground facility where &quot;volunteers&quot; are legally bound to participate in highly questionable medical trials. Work together, survive the experiments, and you might leave rich. Fail...and you'll probably end up as part of the next experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b90460477d448c2563f20627eb57bf35.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Body parts are your weapons and tools. Rip them off, throw them away, and pick up something fresher from the floor. Improvise your arsenal from whatever is still twitching nearby. Arms, claws, mutated limbs -- if it comes off, you can probably use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/d118473ad0f4d757bd0384c19c67accb.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0c84b62f04353f38e45f2701e30dfcbc.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Welcome to Exogen Labs. Our test chambers are filled with puzzles, hazards, and semi-successful mutant \u2018Things\u2019. No trial is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layouts will shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will mutate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all the objectives and escape before the elevator timer expires...or you might expire with it! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/fc576e105f1d52f6d46dce93cb17a998.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/b0c4dd9add45121f3ba666b3df97e63c.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>The trials are designed to test communication and coordination. Survival requires teamwork. You\u2019ll discuss tactics, plan attacks and  occasionally share body parts. Sometimes lending a hand might cost you an arm (and a leg). <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.poster.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.webm?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/48512e1312e4c47f3ea010abdb00eb93.mp4?t=1774319350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/extras/0fee8a603873e026aee104e849ccaf59.avif?t=1774319350\" width=780 height=110 /></span>Survive, adapt, and earn \u2018gold\u2019 - after all, why else would you sign the waiver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>Spend it on upgrades; weapons, buffs, limbs, maybe a tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United you stand. Divided\u2026 you still stand, just on fewer legs.     <br>    </p>","developers":["Flightless"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675340/a961fc94a098aeb8077a01b72fff3304c2ca3454/header.jpg?t=1774319350","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Likeitalot Ltd. All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M1, Intel Core x64 architecture with SSE2 support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon, Metal capable Intel or AMD GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon M2 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675340/512828638/3be84c6433c0a0c6f442cce4837b885523ea46ed/1773797229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773797980","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3675